        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Samuel L. Jackson, Timothy Dalton\n- Films: The Great White Hype, The Living Daylights\n- Roles: General Pushkin\n\nFacts:\n- Timothy Dalton starred in the James Bond film The Living Daylights.\n- In The Living Daylights, Timothy Dalton played James Bond, not \"Mata Bond.\"\n- General Pushkin is a character in The Living Daylights.\n- Samuel L. Jackson was a star of The Great White Hype.\n- Samuel L. Jackson did not play General Pushkin in The Living Daylights; that role was played by John Rhys-Davies.",
